1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 9=

10
00:01:01,150 --> 00:01:03,030
The apprentice you've taken on

11
00:01:03,110 --> 00:01:06,070
has certainly impressed me today.

12
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,410
Your Majesty is too kind.

13
00:01:08,830 --> 00:01:10,150
What Hanyi did

14
00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:12,950
was simply fulfill
her duty as a physician.

15
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:17,700
Yet for the sake of that duty,

16
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:19,500
you made an exception

17
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:21,380
and asked me to issue a decree

18
00:01:21,380 --> 00:01:23,320
sending her into the epidemic zone,
where she might well die.

19
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:24,700
I thought

20
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,160
the first time you asked me for a favor,

21
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:28,590
you would ask
for a promising future for yourself.

22
00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:31,670
I trust her medical skills,

23
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:33,470
and even more, her judgment.

24
00:01:35,220 --> 00:01:36,110
Didn't you teach me

25
00:01:37,670 --> 00:01:40,220
that only by facing death
can one find a way to survive?

26
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:43,260
I believe that in ten days,

27
00:01:44,390 --> 00:01:46,500
she will return to court
and firmly establish herself,

28
00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:49,300
then rise through the ranks.

29
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:52,500
If she wins this round,

30
00:01:52,650 --> 00:01:54,606
I will make an exception and promote her

31
00:01:54,606 --> 00:01:57,100
to Deputy Director
of the Imperial Medical Service.

32
00:01:58,690 --> 00:01:59,680
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

33
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,210
With Hanyi and me working together,

34
00:02:01,750 --> 00:02:04,180
we will rid the realm
of these corrupt parasites.

35
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:10,260
(Ju Yanzhi.
Son of the Minister of Works)

36
00:02:21,870 --> 00:02:24,870
So this is the man you've been praising,
the one you fancy.

37
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:26,540
Keep your voice down.

38
00:02:27,510 --> 00:02:29,590
He absolutely
must not find out how I feel.

39
00:02:31,230 --> 00:02:32,420
If you have feelings for him,

40
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:34,420
why not tell him the truth?

41
00:02:36,230 --> 00:02:37,470
If he doesn't feel the same,

42
00:02:38,470 --> 00:02:39,900
I'd only humiliate myself.

43
00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:50,030
I think he has feelings for you too.

44
00:02:52,470 --> 00:02:52,950
Really?

45
00:03:05,670 --> 00:03:07,350
Miss, be careful.

46
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:16,260
The shimmering water

47
00:03:16,670 --> 00:03:17,790
is truly beautiful.

48
00:03:20,070 --> 00:03:20,790
Zheng Shu!

49
00:03:21,950 --> 00:03:22,510
Miss Zheng!

50
00:03:22,950 --> 00:03:23,260
Miss!

51
00:03:30,350 --> 00:03:30,860
Zheng Shu!

52
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:32,450
Grab my hand! Zheng Shu!

53
00:03:32,580 --> 00:03:33,670
Come on, grab my hand!

54
00:03:33,790 --> 00:03:34,790
Come on, Miss Zheng!

55
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:35,350
Let's go.

56
00:03:38,910 --> 00:03:40,140
Slowly. Be careful.

57
00:03:40,670 --> 00:03:41,300
Careful.

58
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:42,540
Slowly.

59
00:03:46,980 --> 00:03:47,460
Young Lady!

60
00:03:47,650 --> 00:03:48,140
Come.

61
00:03:48,140 --> 00:03:48,630
Young Lady!

62
00:03:51,790 --> 00:03:52,350
Young Lady!

63
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:55,070
Thank you for saving me, Mr. Ju.

64
00:03:55,670 --> 00:03:57,390
Miss Zheng, you are too kind.

65
00:03:57,670 --> 00:03:58,980
It was the least I could do.

66
00:03:59,350 --> 00:04:01,300
Please hurry home
and change your clothes.

67
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:02,740
Don't catch a chill.

68
00:04:03,140 --> 00:04:04,540
Young Lady, let's go home.

69
00:04:05,090 --> 00:04:05,960
You must be freezing.

70
00:04:07,830 --> 00:04:08,350
Tan,

71
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:10,400
make your young lady a bowl
of ginger tea as soon as you get back.

72
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,740
Ginger helps ward off
the cold and warm the body.

73
00:04:11,740 --> 00:04:12,350
Understood?

74
00:04:12,390 --> 00:04:13,790
Yes, I'll remember.

75
00:04:15,850 --> 00:04:16,560
I'll take my leave.

76
00:04:19,460 --> 00:04:20,110
Take care.

77
00:04:21,510 --> 00:04:22,300
Let's go, Young Lady.

78
00:04:38,980 --> 00:04:40,110
Thank you for saving her.

79
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:41,730
I'll take my leave.

80
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:44,300
Take care, Miss Gu.

81
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:53,510
That's the carriage.

82
00:04:54,070 --> 00:04:54,420
- Go.
- Go.

83
00:05:03,350 --> 00:05:03,670
Get out.

84
00:05:03,670 --> 00:05:04,070
Young Lady!

85
00:05:04,420 --> 00:05:04,830
Young Lady!

86
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:06,190
Tan!

87
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:07,260
Run?

88
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:10,020
Gu Hanyi.

89
00:05:10,510 --> 00:05:12,670
Let's see where you can run now.

90
00:05:13,340 --> 00:05:14,460
I'm not Gu Hanyi.

91
00:05:14,700 --> 00:05:15,580
I'm not.

92
00:05:16,020 --> 00:05:16,990
Help!

93
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:17,700
Come here.

94
00:05:17,990 --> 00:05:18,780
Help!

95
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:19,750
Get in.

96
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:43,430
Spending every day
with those rough soldiers

97
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:45,100
is terribly dull.

98
00:05:46,390 --> 00:05:47,390
Only Haitang

99
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:51,070
knows how to put me at ease.

100
00:05:52,190 --> 00:05:53,460
You flatter me, General.

101
00:05:54,780 --> 00:05:56,100
Life at the frontier is harsh.

102
00:05:56,870 --> 00:05:58,660
I'm merely something to help you

103
00:05:58,660 --> 00:05:59,870
pass the time.

104
00:06:06,750 --> 00:06:08,020
While I was in the Capital,

105
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:09,830
I heard some rumors.

106
00:06:10,390 --> 00:06:12,990
I'm not sure whether
I should share them with you.

107
00:06:16,140 --> 00:06:17,260
I'm all ears.

108
00:06:18,900 --> 00:06:20,020
I heard

109
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:23,510
Grand Secretary Cui Hong
has been secretly investigating

110
00:06:23,870 --> 00:06:25,340
your private assets.

111
00:06:26,140 --> 00:06:29,190
I wonder if that counts as a rumor.

112
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:34,100
Cui Hong?

113
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:38,870
He's certainly reaching far.

114
00:06:40,510 --> 00:06:42,190
While I risk my life
fighting at the frontier,

115
00:06:42,850 --> 00:06:44,190
he enjoys a life
of comfort in the Capital.

116
00:06:44,190 --> 00:06:45,360
And he still dares investigate me?

117
00:06:45,990 --> 00:06:47,750
It's only something I heard.

118
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:49,390
What if the rumor isn't true?

119
00:06:59,990 --> 00:07:02,660
It never hurts to be cautious.

120
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:09,630
The men who attacked Zheng Shu today

121
00:07:10,990 --> 00:07:13,310
were sent by Cui Hong's
henchman, Cang Ying.

122
00:07:18,340 --> 00:07:19,340
I put her in danger.

123
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:22,870
All I thought about was using her.

124
00:07:25,100 --> 00:07:25,990
This is all because of me.

125
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:28,260
After what happened,

126
00:07:29,390 --> 00:07:31,750
Censor Zheng
will either turn against you,

127
00:07:32,070 --> 00:07:32,630
or

128
00:07:33,780 --> 00:07:35,990
he will firmly choose to stand with you

129
00:07:36,830 --> 00:07:39,190
and fight Cui Hong alongside you.

130
00:07:39,550 --> 00:07:40,140
Master,

131
00:07:43,220 --> 00:07:44,900
what can I do
to make it up to Zheng Shu?

132
00:07:49,870 --> 00:07:50,630
Hanyi,

133
00:07:52,460 --> 00:07:53,460
calm yourself

134
00:07:55,260 --> 00:07:56,190
and think carefully.

135
00:07:57,510 --> 00:07:59,430
Why didn't Cui Hong
come after you directly?

136
00:08:00,260 --> 00:08:01,830
Why did he resort
to such despicable means

137
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:02,990
to hurt those around you?

138
00:08:10,070 --> 00:08:11,020
He wants to divide us.

139
00:08:12,830 --> 00:08:13,630
As he sees it,

140
00:08:15,020 --> 00:08:16,630
you have not only
Censor Zheng behind you,

141
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:18,260
but also Lord Ju

142
00:08:19,990 --> 00:08:21,580
and the entire faction
of upright officials.

143
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:25,510
His actions show that he's afraid.

144
00:08:25,750 --> 00:08:26,260
Exactly.

145
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,430
The more he resorts
to such despicable means

146
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:29,140
to deal with you,

147
00:08:29,780 --> 00:08:32,140
the more it proves that
he sees you as a serious threat.

148
00:08:33,660 --> 00:08:35,700
We must root out this menace

149
00:08:36,630 --> 00:08:38,310
to avenge Zheng Shu.

150
00:08:47,580 --> 00:08:48,310
Thank you, miss.

151
00:09:13,340 --> 00:09:14,950
He won't want me anymore.

152
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:21,460
After seeing me

153
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:24,660
in such a humiliating state,

154
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:29,150
anyone would find it hard to accept.

155
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:30,580
Miss Zheng.

156
00:09:45,310 --> 00:09:46,030
Zheng Shu.

157
00:09:46,830 --> 00:09:47,700
Listen to me.

158
00:09:48,580 --> 00:09:49,430
You did nothing wrong.

159
00:09:50,910 --> 00:09:52,860
Those vile criminals
are the ones to blame.

160
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:56,950
If Ju Yanzhi looks down
on you because of this,

161
00:09:58,220 --> 00:10:00,100
then he is not worthy
of your sincere affection.

162
00:10:04,100 --> 00:10:05,550
It wasn't my fault?

163
00:10:09,340 --> 00:10:10,430
Then whose fault was it?

164
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:16,070
Yours.

165
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:20,580
Those thugs kept shouting your name

166
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:21,830
as they tried to violate me.

167
00:10:23,220 --> 00:10:25,460
I told them I wasn't Gu Hanyi,

168
00:10:26,700 --> 00:10:27,550
but they wouldn't listen.

169
00:10:29,430 --> 00:10:31,340
They just kept tearing at my clothes.

170
00:10:32,620 --> 00:10:34,790
I cried for help. I begged them to stop.

171
00:10:36,070 --> 00:10:37,220
But they wouldn't listen.

172
00:10:46,700 --> 00:10:48,430
I swear I will take Cui Hong's life

173
00:10:49,810 --> 00:10:51,250
and make him answer
for what he did to you.

174
00:10:58,150 --> 00:10:58,860
Trust me.

175
00:11:00,950 --> 00:11:02,310
I can join forces with your father.

176
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:05,620
What makes you think you're worthy
of joining forces with me?

177
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:18,550
Censor Zheng.

178
00:11:21,220 --> 00:11:21,910
Gu Hanyi.

179
00:11:22,460 --> 00:11:24,150
My daughter suffered
such humiliation because of you.

180
00:11:24,830 --> 00:11:27,310
How do you intend to answer for this?

181
00:11:27,950 --> 00:11:29,860
Father, Hanyi...

182
00:11:29,860 --> 00:11:31,270
My daughter's honor has been ruined.

183
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:32,620
You cannot escape responsibility.

184
00:11:33,550 --> 00:11:34,700
How will you atone for this?

185
00:11:37,430 --> 00:11:39,100
I will offer Cui Hong's head

186
00:11:39,860 --> 00:11:41,830
as retribution for the humiliation
Zheng Shu suffered.

187
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:48,500
You're merely
a lowly ninth-rank official,

188
00:11:49,860 --> 00:11:52,340
yet you dare speak of bringing down
a powerful court official?

189
00:11:53,220 --> 00:11:54,460
I already have a complete plan.

190
00:11:55,430 --> 00:11:56,700
With your help, Censor Zheng,

191
00:11:57,380 --> 00:11:58,460
I can ensure that Cui Hong

192
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:00,860
will never recover from his downfall.

193
00:12:21,030 --> 00:12:23,890
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

194
00:12:24,650 --> 00:12:27,590
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

195
00:12:28,250 --> 00:12:31,070
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

196
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:34,910
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

197
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:39,080
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

198
00:12:39,420 --> 00:12:42,710
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

199
00:12:43,060 --> 00:12:49,540
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

200
00:12:50,330 --> 00:12:57,420
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

201
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:07,770
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

202
00:13:08,070 --> 00:13:09,880
♪I stand here today♪

203
00:13:10,020 --> 00:13:14,530
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

204
00:13:14,530 --> 00:13:22,020
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

205
00:13:22,660 --> 00:13:23,950
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

206
00:13:23,950 --> 00:13:26,350
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

207
00:13:26,790 --> 00:13:33,640
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
